{"id":"eb17d82fac64b1a6","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md","title":"Acceptable Program Numbering","display":"df-acceptable-program-numbering — Acceptable Program Numbering","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering","aliases":["88-df-acceptable-program-numbering"],"display":"df-acceptable-program-numbering — Acceptable Program Numbering","depends_on":["[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","[[88-df-computable-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-acceptable-program-numbering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-acceptable-program-numbering — Acceptable Program Numbering"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N^+\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N^+\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_k=(\\varphi_e^{(k)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\Phi_k=(\\varphi_e^{(k)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi_k=(\\psi_e^{(k)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\Psi_k=(\\psi_e^{(k)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 是候选编号族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\geq1}\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\geq1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffNum}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{EffNum}_k\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是候选总编译函数；等号表示部分函数图相等。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}_k(\\Phi_k)\">\\(\\mathrm{AcceptNum}_k(\\Phi_k)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\)</span> 是本文件定义的可接受编号谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}acceptable\\text{-}program\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AcceptNum}_k(\\Phi_k)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{EffNum}_k(\\Phi_k)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\Psi_k\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{EffNum}_k(\\Psi_k)\\to\n\\exists t\\;\\bigl(t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(t)\n\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\psi_e^{(k)}=\\varphi_{t(e)}^{(k)}\\bigr)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\boldsymbol\\varphi:\\mathbb N^+\\to\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N))\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\mathrm{AcceptNum}_k(\\Phi_k).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}acceptable\\text{-}program\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AcceptNum}_k(\\Phi_k)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{EffNum}_k(\\Phi_k)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\Psi_k\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{EffNum}_k(\\Psi_k)\\to\n\\exists t\\;\\bigl(t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(t)\n\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\psi_e^{(k)}=\\varphi_{t(e)}^{(k)}\\bigr)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\boldsymbol\\varphi:\\mathbb N^+\\to\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N))\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\mathrm{AcceptNum}_k(\\Phi_k).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里采用 Rogers 的编译刻画：任一同元数有效满编号都能通过总可计算索引翻译编译到给定编号。定义没有引用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SMN}\">\\(\\mathrm{SMN}\\)</span> 或固定点结论，所以后续 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 定理不是把其结论当作同名谓词的前提。</p>\n<p>标准句法图灵机编号满足此条件：对给定源编号的通用求值程序，把源索引写成目标程序中的常量，再执行该求值程序，即可有效产生目标程序码。这个编译过程只操作有限程序文本，不使用递归定理。使用任意编号的定理仍须在假设或蕴涵前件中显式写出可接受性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-computable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EffNum}_k$ 见 [[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]；$\\mathrm{Comp}_1$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EffNum}_k$ 见 [[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]；$\\mathrm{Comp}_1$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_k=(\\varphi_e^{(k)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Psi_k=(\\psi_e^{(k)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EffNum}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_1","display":false},{"tex":"t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}_k(\\Phi_k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}acceptable\\text{-}program\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AcceptNum}_k(\\Phi_k)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{EffNum}_k(\\Phi_k)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\Psi_k\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{EffNum}_k(\\Psi_k)\\to\n\\exists t\\;\\bigl(t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(t)\n\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\psi_e^{(k)}=\\varphi_{t(e)}^{(k)}\\bigr)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\boldsymbol\\varphi:\\mathbb N^+\\to\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N))\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\mathrm{AcceptNum}_k(\\Phi_k).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SMN}","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":2171,"backlinks":[{"id":"63bffa02095213d3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"该固定编号满足 $\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)$，其含义与标准编译论证见 [[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]。"},{"id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"有效满编号本身不蕴含可接受性。需要统一编译的定理必须另引 [[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]，或显式给出所需的 $s$-$m$-$n$ 前提。整个编号族是共同的环境参数；不能在同一证明中未经说明地更换 $\\varphi_e$ 的解释。"},{"id":"b23177f17eeaa7a2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"背景理论为 ZFC。固定 $\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)$ 的标准程序编号，见 [[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]；$\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}$ 见 [[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]。"},{"id":"75e301ab0a784049","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)$ 见 [[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]；$\\mathrm{Comp}_1$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]；$\\mathrm{KFP}$ 见 [[88-df-recursion-theorem]]。"},{"id":"4aed37dba54730e2","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\boldsymbol\\varphi$ 是 [[88-df-effective-program-numbering]] 的共同编号环境；$\\mathrm{AcceptNum}$ 见 [[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]。"},{"id":"d537b31e66e4fbaf","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\boldsymbol\\varphi$ 是 [[88-df-effective-program-numbering]] 的固定编号环境；$\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)$ 见 [[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]。"},{"id":"2e54d7c09866228f","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)$ 见 [[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]；该性质在断言前件中要求。"},{"id":"0d1300ef33ffd8df","anchor":"ref-80","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"所有数值/词编码使用 [[88-df-encoding]] 的固定定义性函数词汇；编号的可接受性见 [[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]。"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-delta.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hi